      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2811\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/11/01/wood-007/material_553/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_553\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2811 size-full\" title=\"wood grain furniture\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"wood grain furniture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2811\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/11/01/wood-007/material_553/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_553\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2811 size-full lazyload\" title=\"wood grain furniture\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"wood grain furniture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/material_553.png\"></p>\n<p>Wood 007 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<p><strong>For Patrons there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompress